# Coffee

{ rating="4" image="coffee.jpeg" }
:::
:::

## Ingredients

- Hot Coffee

  - [ ] [Starbucks Cafe Verona]{ ing="starbucks-cafe-verona" }
- Iced

  - [ ] Starbucks Dark Roast [Unsweetened Iced Coffee]{ ing="unsweetened-iced-coffee" } (Purple Band, Green Lid)
  - [ ] Stok Unsweetened Extra [Bold Cold Brew]{ ing="bold-cold-brew" } (Vertical Purple Strip)
- Accompaniments

  - [ ] [Original Nestle Coffee Mate]{ ing="original-nestle-coffee-mate" }
  - [ ] Caramel Macchiato International [Delight Coffee Creamer]{ ing="delight-coffee-creamer" }

## Recipe

1. Per cup of [coffee]{ ing="unsweetened-iced-coffee" }:

   1. 2 scoops of ground [coffee]{ ing="unsweetened-iced-coffee" }
   1. fill to the “2” line for water
   1. switch to the “mug” setting, if making a single cup
   1. Add 2 tsp [coffee mate]{ ing="original-nestle-coffee-mate" }
   1. 1.5 tsp sugar
1. To make ice [coffee]{ ing="unsweetened-iced-coffee" }:

   1. Fill a small cup with ice
   1. Fill with ice [coffee]{ ing="unsweetened-iced-coffee" }
   1. Add a small amount of [creamer]{ ing="delight-coffee-creamer" } to taste
